==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la}} ''inception-'', stem of {{term|inceptio|lang=la}}, from {{term|inceptus|lang=la}}, [[past participle]] of {{term|incipere|tr=to begin|lang=la}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|En-us-inception.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# The [[creation]] or [[beginning]] of something; the [[establishment]].
#: ''From its '''inception''' the agency has been helping people obtain and properly install lucid dreaming devices.''

